--- !u!114 &114416093822256089
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1122263233841982}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 721
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 当年的枯木师弟啊，比起长生他更追求力量。当别的竹山弟子悠闲地研读功法或是煮茶论道时，他却独自在外斩妖除魔，日复一日地磨练神通使用技巧。那时候我还在想，枯木师弟这种与竹山宗格格不入的性子，也许离火门更适合他。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114380967026490164}
  AvatarIntID: 1
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
